extends RefCounted
## Items of «Бесконечный поезд» (docs/TRAIN_ITEMS.md): kept for the whole run, each one
## changes the hero for good. Chests, elites, bosses and sometimes common fights give
## them (TrainRun._offer_items). What an item does is its "mods", added up over all items
## the hero has (TrainRun.bonus):
##   hero stats (TrainRun.STATS): crit, crit_dmg, dodge, armor, lifesteal, thorns, regen,
##     draw, hand, luck; max_hp is applied once, when the item is taken (current HP too
##     when it grows);
##   fight only (TrainRun.FIGHT_STATS, TrainRules.set_stats): actions (more every turn),
##     atk (ATK of every creature), bleed (HP the hero loses at the start of a turn);
##   the run: win_heal (HP after a won fight), hp_per_win (max HP after a won fight),
##     fight_hp (HP at the start of a fight), rest_heal, xp_win (XP for a won fight),
##     xp_elite (XP for a won elite fight), min_deck (the deck a rest cannot thin below);
##   rules of the fight (TrainRun.ITEM_RULES, played by Game where the cards are played,
##     die, attack and so on): what each one does is its item's text.
## "look" is what the item looks like: for its picture later.

